{
  "info": {
    "name": "FoC Chat",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": "AI Assistance Disclosure: Tool: Claude Code (model: Claude Opus 5.5), date: 2026-11-08. Scope: generated this collection from the chat plan Author review: Reviewed by Deanson, 2026-11-09.\n\nHTTP half of the chat check, through the gateway (Envoy on :3003). SETUP: add CHAT_TICKET_SECRET (32+ characters) to the root .env, then `docker compose up -d --build`. Set emailA, emailB, emailC and password to three verified accounts (A requester, B courier with no active order, C unrelated). Run folder 0, then folder 1. Tokens last 15 minutes.\n\nSOCKET HALF (Postman can't save Socket.IO requests in a collection file): New → Socket.IO. URL ws://localhost:3003, Settings → Client version v4, Handshake path /gateway/socket.io/. Put the ticket in the handshake auth payload {\"ticket\": \"...\"} (or use chat-service/scripts/try-chat.mjs). Tickets last 10 seconds: run 'Ticket for A' and connect straight away. Listen for newMessage. Emit with acknowledgement: sendMessage {\"clientMsgId\":\"m1\",\"content\":\"hi\"}, getHistory {} or {\"beforeId\":N}, getMissedMessages {\"afterId\":0}. Open a second tab with B's ticket to see live delivery. Debug without Envoy: ws://localhost:3008, path /socket.io/."
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "0. Setup (log in, create an order)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Log in as A",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{gatewayUrl}}/auth/login",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{emailA}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('tokenA', pm.response.json().accessToken);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Log in as B",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{gatewayUrl}}/auth/login",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{emailB}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('tokenB', pm.response.json().accessToken);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Log in as C",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{gatewayUrl}}/auth/login",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{emailC}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('tokenC', pm.response.json().accessToken);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Pick two ACTIVE locations",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{tokenA}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{gatewayUrl}}/locations"
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const active = pm.response.json().items.filter((l) => l.status === 'ACTIVE');",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('pickupId', active[0].id);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('deliveryId', active[1].id);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Create an order (A) → PENDING",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{tokenA}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{gatewayUrl}}/orders",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"orderDescription\": \"Chat test (Postman)\",\n  \"pickupLocationId\": {{pickupId}},\n  \"deliveryLocationId\": {{deliveryId}},\n  \"creditOffer\": 1\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('status 201', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('orderId', pm.response.json().id);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('version', pm.response.json().version);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "1. Chat tickets",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Ticket on a PENDING order (A) → 403",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{tokenA}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{gatewayUrl}}/orders/{{orderId}}/chat-ticket"
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('status 403', () => pm.response.to.have.status(403));",
                  "pm.test('error FORBIDDEN', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().error.code).to.eql('FORBIDDEN'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Accept (B) → ACCEPTED",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{tokenB}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{gatewayUrl}}/orders/{{orderId}}/accept",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"version\": {{version}}\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Ticket for A → 200",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{tokenA}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{gatewayUrl}}/orders/{{orderId}}/chat-ticket"
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('ticketA', pm.response.json().ticket);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Ticket for B → 200",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{tokenB}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{gatewayUrl}}/orders/{{orderId}}/chat-ticket"
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('ticketB', pm.response.json().ticket);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Ticket for C (not a participant) → 403",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{tokenC}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{gatewayUrl}}/orders/{{orderId}}/chat-ticket"
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('status 403', () => pm.response.to.have.status(403));",
                  "pm.test('error FORBIDDEN', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().error.code).to.eql('FORBIDDEN'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Ticket without a token → 401",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{gatewayUrl}}/orders/{{orderId}}/chat-ticket"
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('status 401', () => pm.response.to.have.status(401));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Ticket for an unknown order → 404",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{tokenA}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{gatewayUrl}}/orders/00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000000/chat-ticket"
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('status 404', () => pm.response.to.have.status(404));",
                  "pm.test('error NOT_FOUND', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().error.code).to.eql('NOT_FOUND'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Chat health (direct, port 3008) → 200",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{chatUrl}}/health"
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
